<step1>
<ptxt>Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart by ECU</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Using the SST (TaSCAN), CAN communication system DTCs can be displayed by ECU.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If CAN communication system DTCs are output, the malfunction cannot be identified from the DTCs alone; therefore, perform troubleshooting from "How to Proceed with Troubleshooting" (refer to <xref label="Seep03" href="RM000001R4W019X"/>).</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
