<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Diagnostic communication is performed via CAN communication.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The EFI ECU also outputs data of the distance control computer assembly (ACC ECU).</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>*1: These are cruise system DTCs.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>*2:TaSCAN: If it is displayed on the "Communication Malfunction DTC Check" screen but the EFI ECU outputs only U0235 and U1102, it is not a CAN communication malfunction. (Refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000064N00DX"/> and <xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000064Q00CX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
